/home  Goes home.  command
/new  Goes home with the cursor in the input box.  command
/resume  Opens home at the session list.  command
/handoff [instructions]  Starts a handoff.  command▀▄
/name <text>  Names the session.  command ████  █▄▄▄▀
/reload  Reloads configuration, MCP servers and extensions.  command
/close  Stops the session on screen.  command▄▄ █   █ 0.0.1
/quit  Quits.  command
